<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="905221558"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:26.467"><div begin="12.854" end="39.933" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.854" end="17.078" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.854" end="14.040">有些人用一</span><span begin="14.040" end="15.457">辈子去</span><span begin="15.457" end="16.409">学</span><span begin="16.409" end="17.078">习</span></p><p begin="17.407" end="21.193" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.407" end="17.928">化解</span><span begin="17.928" end="19.365">沟通的</span><span begin="19.365" end="20.332">难</span><span begin="20.332" end="21.193">题</span></p><p begin="21.338" end="24.662" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.338" end="21.839">为你</span><span begin="21.839" end="23.295">我也可</span><span begin="23.295" end="24.662">以</span></p><p begin="28.459" end="32.566" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.459" end="29.513">我的快乐</span><span begin="29.513" end="29.962">与</span><span begin="29.962" end="30.932">恐惧</span><span begin="30.932" end="31.832">猜</span><span begin="31.832" end="32.566">疑</span></p><p begin="32.682" end="36.306" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.682" end="33.283">很想都</span><span begin="33.283" end="34.284">翻译</span><span begin="34.284" end="35.634">成言</span><span begin="35.634" end="36.306">语</span></p><p begin="36.695" end="39.933" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.695" end="37.097">带你</span><span begin="37.097" end="37.617">进</span><span begin="37.617" end="38.485">我心</span><span begin="38.485" end="39.933">底</span></p></div><div begin="43.641" end="1:14.854" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.641" end="47.838" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.641" end="44.516">我们就像</span><span begin="44.516" end="45.322">隔着</span><span begin="45.322" end="46.258">一层</span><span begin="46.258" end="47.158">玻</span><span begin="47.158" end="47.838">璃</span></p><p begin="47.933" end="51.432" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.933" 